{
  "_what_this_is": "The v4 implementation pack, as handed over. Twelve screens with their variations, twenty-nine component specimens, the notes explaining each screen and the seven-file data snapshot the designer worked from.",
  "_why_it_is_here": "This is what /next/ is built from. Unlike v2 and v3 it did not come off a live host, so there is no --check to re-fetch it against: it arrived as a zip and the zip's hash is the whole provenance. Hashed anyway, because the question a month from now is the same one \u2014 did we build what was handed over, or did we drift.",
  "_what_is_not_copied": "The pack's own stylesheet and scripts. Its tokens.css carries 230 mechanically generated custom properties (--v4-margin-1: 0, --v4-font-5: inherit) alongside about seventy real ones; taking the file would take both. The real values and every layout decision are implemented in assets/next.css, and tokens.css is kept here as the reference to check against.",
